{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to experience this third-person rhythm shooter that perfectly blends music and explosions. This demo offers about 1 hour of early-game content, including 2 full levels, giving you a first taste of the power of &quot;Annihilation Beat&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200b[Demo Core Experience]\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Revolutionary Rhythm Shooter Gameplay: Every attack must sync perfectly with the background music. If you\u2019re off the beat, you won\u2019t survive. Feel the thrill of beat-driven combat, transforming musical energy into destructive firestorms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 2 Carefully Designed Introductory Levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Initial Sonic Arsenal: The demo unlocks 2 sonic weapons:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Pulse Wave]</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Beat Blaster]</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200b[Demo Notes]\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 The full version will include more weapons (e.g., &quot;Bass Cannon&quot;, &quot;High-Frequency Blade&quot;), more levels, and boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to follow your inner drumbeat and carve a path through the apocalypse? </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4017650?t=1758643658","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4017650?t=1758643658","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017650/8808ef0b884e7a47436e57b6d86783b6cbb3de9c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758643658","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017650/8808ef0b884e7a47436e57b6d86783b6cbb3de9c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758643658","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to experience this third-person rhythm shooter that perfectly blends music and explosions. This demo offers about 1 hour of early-game content, including 2 full levels, giving you a first taste of the power of &quot;Annihilation Beat&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200b[Demo Core Experience]\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Revolutionary Rhythm Shooter Gameplay: Every attack must sync perfectly with the background music. If you\u2019re off the beat, you won\u2019t survive. Feel the thrill of beat-driven combat, transforming musical energy into destructive firestorms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 2 Carefully Designed Introductory Levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Initial Sonic Arsenal: The demo unlocks 2 sonic weapons:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Pulse Wave]</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Beat Blaster]</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200b[Demo Notes]\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 The full version will include more weapons (e.g., &quot;Bass Cannon&quot;, &quot;High-Frequency Blade&quot;), more levels, and boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to follow your inner drumbeat and carve a path through the apocalypse? </p>","developers":["\u5341\u5e74"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3909700","name":"Rhythm of Annihilation"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017650/8ac1eeed48d10504980ea414798210b21f439c2a/header.jpg?t=1758643658","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257194365,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257194365/movie480.mp4?t=175860